<Slide
  style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1220', padding: '20px 64px', flexDirection: 'column' }}
  notes={`@EmbedSensitive 宏的用法很直接：在源文件顶层调用，把它要嵌入的配置项名写进去就行，逗号分隔也可以。

它展开后是一个立即执行的匿名闭包，里面一串 Config.registerSensitive 调用，把你的敏感项和 SM4 的六个参数逐个注册进去。

嵌入规则有五条。第一，编译期取不到值的名字会被忽略——编译机上没有对应环境变量，就不注册。第二，编译期配了 sm4Key 就写密文，否则写 UTF8 明文。第三，只有「至少注册了一项敏感值」并且「sm4Key 非空」的时候，才把 SM4 的六个参数一并写入，而且这六个参数本身是按明文字节写入的。第四，同名重复注册以最后一次为准。第五，运行期读取仍然遵循 4.3 的优先级。

最后说一下 f_orm 和它的关系：f_orm 就是基于这个宏的封装。它在 ProtectedMacros 目录下生成 ORM 的连接串、用户名、口令这几个键，再转调 @EmbedSensitive，最终在 f_orm 里以 @ORMEmbedSensitive 触发。所以在 boot.sh 里写的 postgres_orm_connectionUrl 才能被嵌进产物。`}
>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 4 章 · 配置 f_config · 4.6</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>@EmbedSensitive 宏</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>编译期嵌入的实现</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 348, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 520, background: '#111C2E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0' }}>用法：源文件顶层调用</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#22D3EE', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 8, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>@EmbedSensitive(paySecretKey pushToken)</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 4 }}>逗号分隔亦可。编译机上没有对应环境变量就不注册。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 14 }}>嵌入规则</Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>1　编译期取不到值的名字会被忽略</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>2　编译期配了 sm4Key 写密文，否则写 UTF8 明文</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>3　仅在「有敏感值」且「sm4Key 非空」时写入 SM4 六参数</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>4　同名重复注册以最后一次为准</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>5　运行期读取仍遵循 4.3 的优先级</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 'auto' }}>SM4 六个参数本身按明文字节写入。</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 18, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', marginBottom: 8 }}>展开后：一个立即执行的匿名闭包</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"private let _ = {=>"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    Config.registerSensitive('paySecretKey', [...])"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    Config.registerSensitive('pushToken', [...])"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    Config.registerSensitive('sm4Operation', ...)"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    Config.registerSensitive('sm4Padding', ...)"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    Config.registerSensitive('sm4Key', ...)"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    Config.registerSensitive('sm4Iv', ...)"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    Config.registerSensitive('sm4Aad', ...)"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    Config.registerSensitive('sm4TagSize', ...)"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.85, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"}()"}</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(56,189,248,0.06)', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #38BDF8', padding: 18, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#38BDF8' }}>f_orm 就是基于这个宏的封装</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 6 }}>f_orm/src/ProtectedMacros/EmbedSensitive.cj 生成 ORM 的连接串 / 用户名 / 口令键，再转调 @EmbedSensitive，最终在 f_orm 里以 @ORMEmbedSensitive() 触发。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 6 }}>所以你在 boot.sh 里写的 --postgres_orm_connectionUrl=... 才能被嵌进产物。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderTop: '1px solid #1E293B' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>fountain · 一站式服务器应用开发工具库</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>29 / 116</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
